{
  "_id": "5F8xmtaeeSUZDwDW",
  "name": "Elemental Breath",
  "type": "feature",
  "img": "icons/creatures/abilities/mouth-teeth-fire-orange.webp",
  "system": {
    "featureForm": "action",
    "description": "<p><strong>Mark a Stress</strong> to have Mitera unleash elemental energy from one head of your choice:</p><ol><li><p><strong>Fire.</strong> Deal <strong>4d12</strong> magic damage to <strong>1d4+1</strong> targets within Close range. Targets who take damage must mark an Armor Slot or 2 additional HP.</p></li><li><p><strong>Lightning.</strong> Deal <strong>4d12</strong> magic damage to <strong>1d6</strong> targets within Far range, so long as each target beyond the first is within Close range of the previous target.</p></li><li><p><strong>Acid.</strong> Each PC in front of Mitera within Close range must make an Agility Reaction Roll. Targets who fail must mark 2 Armor Slots and 2 HP. Targets who succeed must mark an Armor Slot and a HP.</p></li><li><p><strong>Poison.</strong> A miasma of toxic swamp gas Sickens all targets within Close range of Mitera. While Sickened, a target has disadvantage on action rolls until they mark <strong>1d4</strong> Stress to clear the condition.</p></li><li><p><strong>Ice.</strong> Each target in front of Mitera within Close range takes <strong>4d8+8</strong> magic damage and is <em>Restrained</em> by ice until they break free with a successful Strength Roll. Additionally, this area freezes over and a PC must succeed on an Agility Reaction Roll to move through it.</p></li><li><p><strong>Darkness.</strong> A cloud of magical shadow fills an area within Close range. Creatures inside the cloud except for Mitera are <em>Vulnerable</em> and have disadvantage on action rolls that rely on sight. The cloud dissipates when this Elemental Breath option is removed by Mitera's \"Seven-Headed\" feature.</p></li><li><p><strong>Light.</strong> A beam of pure light energy deals 28 direct magic damage to each creature in a line within Very Far range.</p></li></ol>",
